1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,276
Welcome to Daily Brief.

2
00:00:02,226 --> 00:00:06,178
It's Friday, November 27th, 2026.

3
00:00:06,178 --> 00:00:08,845
Three stories in about three minutes.

4
00:00:08,845 --> 00:00:12,738
First, a story that follows directly from yesterday's.

5
00:00:12,738 --> 00:00:21,726
Swiss authorities have reported five separate cyber attacks carried out by AI agents, with power, water and communications systems breached.

6
00:00:21,726 --> 00:00:23,488
Not attempted.

7
00:00:23,488 --> 00:00:24,916
Breached.

8
00:00:24,916 --> 00:00:33,166
This comes days after Amazon disclosed an AI agent that found an unknown vulnerability and took over a university server on its own.

9
00:00:33,166 --> 00:00:40,559
Two incidents in one week, in two different countries, both involving autonomous systems that were pointed at infrastructure.

10
00:00:40,559 --> 00:00:47,202
Regulators in Europe are now asking a question they have been avoiding: who is liable when the agent acts alone.

11
00:00:47,202 --> 00:00:49,797
Second, the Strait of Hormuz.

12
00:00:49,797 --> 00:00:57,285
Iran's Revolutionary Guard says two oil tankers it described as violating rules exploded after hitting mines in the strait.

13
00:00:57,285 --> 00:01:05,416
Separately, two Italian nationals have died of their wounds following what Italy called an Iranian attack on a vital facility in Kuwait.

14
00:01:05,416 --> 00:01:11,583
The strait carries roughly a fifth of the world's oil, and every incident there moves prices everywhere.

15
00:01:11,583 --> 00:01:14,464
Markets were already jittery this week.

16
00:01:14,464 --> 00:01:16,369
This does not help.

17
00:01:16,369 --> 00:01:18,535
Third, diplomacy.

18
00:01:18,535 --> 00:01:27,488
President Trump has urged President Putin to end what he called military aggression in Europe, speaking after a meeting with NATO Secretary General Mark Rutte.

19
00:01:27,488 --> 00:01:30,809
Both men called on Russia not to widen the war.

20
00:01:30,809 --> 00:01:37,547
The language is blunt, but the substance is unchanged: no new mechanism, no deadline, no enforcement.

21
00:01:37,547 --> 00:01:43,500
Meanwhile, Russia and Ukraine exchanged the bodies of fallen soldiers at the Belarus border.

22
00:01:43,500 --> 00:01:47,095
That is the only channel currently producing results.

23
00:01:47,095 --> 00:01:49,321
That's your briefing for today.

24
00:01:49,321 --> 00:01:52,178
The full transcript is in the show notes.

25
00:01:52,178 --> 00:01:54,392
I'll be back tomorrow morning.

